# Cursor Rules: Modern Paper & Folia Development
- Use Kyori Adventure & MiniMessage (`<green>`, `<gradient:...>`). Never use ChatColor or '§'.
- Use DataComponentTypes for items.
- Use Display Entities with JOML Matrix4f transformations for holograms.
- Adhere to Folia region-threading rules.
- Audit security using `npx papermc-skill audit`.

